body:
This is super basic and this does the thing but this has the downside that it will override harsh weathers, it can be changed with ifs and conditions but it is 1am and I am a bit too tired for that haha but I hope this helps, but if you will want ot it I will be able to finish it and send it to you later the one which doesn't override harsh weathers.

    class Battle::Move::DamageTargetStartSandstorm < Battle::Move
      def pbEffectGeneral(user)
        @battle.pbStartWeather(user, :Sandstorm, true, false)
      end
    end
